<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coca Cola Femsa raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coca Cola Femsa raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co on Thursday raised its rating for Mexican bottler Coca Cola Femsa SA de CV to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The upgrade was &quot;based on a stronger expected margin improvement in 4Q96 and '97 and on a recent weakness in the share price. Raising the target price from $31 to $35, implying an upside of 24 percent,&quot; the firm said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed up 1-7/8 to 29-7/8 on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
